WEBVTT

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:15.280
One-two, one-two, one-two, one-two, one-two.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.570
Hey, Mitsuhide.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.290
Yes, my lord.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.920
I was certain of my castle's strength,

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.340
but now, it's only ash.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.800
New days are coming, aren't they?

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.550
My lord... Yes!

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.420
Nobunaga-dono,

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:44.620
we'll be on our way.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.410
That's so sudden...

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:47.730
We may not look it,

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:50.170
but we each rule a country.

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:53.860
We can't stay away for too long.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:57.980
When we left, we told them 
we had business in the capital.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:01.740
We haven't actually finished that business, either.

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.750
I'm greatly in your debt.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:08.050
We'll have you pay us back someday.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:10.000
With interest.

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:13.440
Where's Hideyoshi?

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.760
I don't know...

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:18.170
Tell her to send them off.

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:18.760
Right.

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:25.480
It smells so good.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:26.940
Think it's about done now?

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:30.840
The food here's always so good, you know?

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:32.390
Maybe I'll take home

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:34.410
one of the cooks, as my payment.

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:37.150
You haven't the right.

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:38.070
What?

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:42.120
This victory was only possible because of me.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.690
Don't be stupid!

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:45.560
If it not for me, we wouldn't have had a chance!

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:49.420
Come on. Stop, you guys!

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:51.440
You're right next to a boiling pot!

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:53.400
It's dangerous!

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:56.370
Are you listening to me?

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:57.510
Come on!

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.280
Why not give up and accept 
your weakness, already?

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.550
That's my line!

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:06.730
Isn't it time we put all that away?

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:10.010
Ieyasu-chan is back safe now.

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:13.650
For once, I really was worried...

00:02:13.970 --> 00:02:14.930
Let me go!

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:18.610
Tokunyan and the others are 
totally back to normal.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.030
Right, sensei...

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:23.290
Date-sensei?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.560
It isn't broken!

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:19.710
This...

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:22.280
It's still...

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.720
Oh, there you are, Date-sensei!

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:36.250
You just vanished, so I got worried...

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:41.620
Date-sensei?

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:49.680
<b>Episode 13</b>

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:49.680
<b>Sunlight Maiden</b>

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.760
Date-sensei...

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:54.840
I think... I can't give up, after all.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.060
What?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:58.520
This is fate.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.360
W-Wait...

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:03.030
Hideyoshi, what are you doing?

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.330
My lord is looking...

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.660
A-Akerin!

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:09.540
What are you doing?

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.380
This is mine.

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:12.980
It was to be mine from the start.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.340
What?! That's my lord's—

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:16.790
I won't let Nobunaga have it!

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.170
What?

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.500
Wait!

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.500
Sensei... What's wrong with you?

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.210
I must fix things.

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:26.010
What?

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.680
Have you never thought of how awful it was?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.440
What do you mean?

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:34.540
There is no hope, no dreams, 
in the world we're from.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:37.020
You thought so, too, right?

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.820
Everyone thinks only of themselves.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:43.300
They don't care about others.

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:47.230
I hated it.

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:48.530
Sensei...

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:52.160
And then I heard the legend 
of the Crimson Armor.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.790
And I thought to myself,

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:56.410
until we fix the mistakes of the past,

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.790
we can never have a bright future.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:03.160
I tried to travel back through time for myself,

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:05.460
and for the dreams of my ancestors.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.050
But instead, I found myself here,

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:11.290
where there is no Date Masamune.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.990
So I thought I would

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:17.520
at least prove my ideals correct here.

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:22.060
Only someone who bears the blood of Date, 
like myself, could do that.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.490
If I can't fix our world,

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:27.990
I'll use the armor to turn this one into a utopia.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:32.030
It will be not Nobunaga, not Ieyasu, but me...

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:33.580
Masamune, you...

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:37.780
You'll help me, right, Hide-san?

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:40.580
Sensei, I...

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.730
Then show me your resolve!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.090
My lord!

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:01.360
If you claim you are truly

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:05.060
prepared to wear the armor and conquer,

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:08.400
then show me here and now.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:12.330
What's going on?

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:15.740
What are you doing here? Food's...

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:24.710
Masamune, I thought like you do.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.520
Conquest was my dream.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:33.170
So, when you gave me the scroll,

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:36.480
I thought it would help me.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.300
After I conquered,

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.880
if anyone stood in my way,

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:44.740
I would simply use the armor to defeat them...

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:46.180
That was my thought.

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:51.980
But even had I worn the armor 
and ruled the people by force,

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:54.790
it would not have been true conquest.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:58.870
To conquer. To rule equally over all.

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:03.620
Over these past days, 
I've learned what that truly means.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:09.050
The scroll said the last woman to don that armor

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:12.430
infuriated the gods, right?

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:13.420
Yes.

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:19.660
Even had I worn it, I most likely would have

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:22.210
met the same fate.

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:25.400
It's the same with you, Masamune!

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:28.690
Shiro...

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:30.720
What's going on?

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:32.200
Yoshimoto-dono.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:37.220
I learned how powerless I was.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:40.280
When I fought Ieyasu,

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:43.160
I could do nothing alone.

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:47.410
It was only because of everyone here

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:53.340
that I could protect my retainers, 
my people, and the land.

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:57.950
Conquest isn't about force.

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:01.860
It's about believing in people, 
and having them believe in you.

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.340
That is what I learned.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.300
However, Masamune...

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:09.640
If you refuse to believe that,

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:14.860
and still wish to wear the armor to conquer,

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.870
then, in the heavens' place, I will punish you!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.100
Put on the armor.

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:26.360
I will defeat you, even at the cost of my life!

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:31.500
And should Nobunaga-dono fall,

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.650
I would be your next opponent!

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:36.160
No, it would be me.

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:39.760
I refuse to follow a power I don't respect!

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:45.270
Aren't you scared of me... Of the armor?

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:49.820
A gloomy little girl like you isn't up to the job.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:52.100
I agree.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:55.490
I don't even know who you really are.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.240
I couldn't possibly obey you.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:01.410
I shall never recognize you, either!

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:04.270
A-All right...

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:07.770
I'll just have to get rid of everyone who—

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:10.640
Sensei! Stop it!

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:14.590
You can't fight my lord!

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:17.140
I-I have to...

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:20.860
If I'm to right this world, 
I need everyone's obedience,

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:23.100
even if I must compel it!

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:24.260
No...

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:27.230
My lord, please put that away!

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:31.480
Fine... I'll show you my resolve.

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:32.730
Sensei!

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.660
Huh? What's wrong with it?

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.660
Sensei, stop it!

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:35.670
Hideyoshi...

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:41.620
This is the answer I've found.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:15.320
The world doesn't need the Crimson Armor.

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:20.400
We can forge a future ourselves.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:27.200
Why don't you let this go?

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.560
I know you understand.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.280
Sensei...

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:40.570
Hide-san...

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:42.270
I...

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:44.720
Sensei...

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:10.630
We broke the armor. But it's for the best, right?

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:11.590
Yeah.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.130
Sensei, you're awake?

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.860
Nobunaga's changed, you know that?

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:24.340
When I first met her, she wasn't like that.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:25.750
No?

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.830
She was more ambitious.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:33.140
She'd do anything for her goal...

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:35.540
I see.

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:38.390
I think meeting you changed her.

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:40.090
Hide-san...

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:43.110
Anything that didn't go well,

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:46.320
I always blamed on other people, 
or on the world itself.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.700
But that was wrong.

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:51.660
I'm the one who must change.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:58.000
I'd have liked to have met 
Lord Date Masamune, though.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.500
That was your ancestor, right?

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.470
I wonder what would've happened, 
had the real Lord Masamune

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.150
worn the Crimson Armor.

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:10.930
Wouldn't they have broken it, like my lord?

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:16.860
You said they were amazing, right?

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:20.900
Yes... You may be right.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.130
Hey, Hide-san...

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:30.910
What?

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:34.790
I don't think we can stay here.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:39.050
Let's go back to our world.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:45.800
Yeah.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:48.050
That's right.

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.060
Goodbye.

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:53.010
Thanks.

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:54.990
No, thank you.

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:58.540
No, if only I had kept a better eye on her...

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.560
That's in the past.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:04.260
Everyone's safe, so all is well.

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.900
I'm so sorry, Nobunaga-oneesama...

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.190
I'll be back soon—

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:10.730
No, that's fine!

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:13.070
You must be tired, right?

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:16.760
Go back to your castle and rest.

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:19.060
Rest a long time...

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:21.360
Thank you for your concern,

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:23.530
Mitsuhide-san...

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:27.110
Be careful that nothing 
"unfortunate" happens to you.

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:31.400
She really is dangerous...

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.670
Tokunyan hasn't changed at all.

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.140
Hideyoshi.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.870
Once things are settled here,

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.540
come hunting with me again.

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:39.690
I'll throw you a party.

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:41.510
Me, too.

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:42.630
I'll be waiting.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:45.630
Th-Thank you...

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:46.310
Bye.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:47.570
See you later!

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:51.590
We should get back, too.

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.750
What's wrong, Hideyoshi?

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.590
You seem unhappy.

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.760
You can see them again, once things calm down.

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:06.690
No, actually... Um...

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:10.470
We're going home, too.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:11.900
What?

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:14.850
You said you didn't know how.

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.400
That's right. Masamune...

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:19.930
She said she came from the same place, right?

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:21.680
Yes.

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:23.540
I see.

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:26.010
Then come see me when you're ready.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:27.020
OK.

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:31.740
That was easier than I expected.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.640
My lord's shy.

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:34.930
Is she?

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.350
She is!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.810
Shiro!

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:39.570
Heading home?

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.350
Yeah.

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:42.690
What is this dog?

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:43.500
I see. Be well.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:45.310
Sensei?

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:48.950
That dog... That dog was talking.

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:53.230
Oh, you mean Shiro? Yeah, he talks.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:57.310
Does he? Is that how this world works?

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:10.280
Good... It's all back to normal.

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:12.910
Hideyoshi.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:16.780
It may be more damaged because we hurried, but...

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:19.120
I had the priestess at Honnouji

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.290
gather everything we left there.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:24.290
This was the only thing of yours we found.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:28.170
I'd totally forgotten about this, Akerin!

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.380
You said it was important.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.880
Akerin!

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:34.590
Thank you, Akerin!

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:35.080
Hey, stop!

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:36.270
What are you doing?

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:38.970
I'll be so glad when you're gone!

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:39.890
Oh, Akerin.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.280
You're such a tsundere!

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:43.230
Be more dere!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.510
Thank you... No,

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:47.770
I'm sorry for the trouble I've caused you.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.360
And you, as well.

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:52.320
That's right.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:54.210
If you were a warrior,

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:56.370
I would've killed you without hesitation.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:59.980
I guess, to make it up to you...

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:03.620
If you want to seduce 
someone like Nobunaga-san...

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:08.800
All right?

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:13.690
How can you be so perverted...

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:14.770
Good luck!

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:16.440
Right...

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:17.540
My lord.

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:20.350
Thank you!

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:23.740
I should thank you.

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:30.570
Thanks to you, I understand 
Nobusada-dono's words.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:34.170
<i>The hearts of women are like flowing water.</i>

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.740
Oh, that's right.

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:40.490
If I hadn't met you, 
I'd have killed Ieyasu and Masamune.

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:44.610
I would've tried to rule the people by my katana.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:48.630
And in the end, I might have been 
punished for it by the gods.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.580
So it's thanks to you.

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:52.440
Thank you.

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:53.170
No, it's not...

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:58.930
I will never forget the days I spent with you.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:02.900
They were truly fun.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:06.940
My lord... For me, too.

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:09.200
I'll tell you one thing.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:14.640
No matter what happens, believe in yourself.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:19.450
Live to the fullest, and your future will shine.

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:20.980
Yes!

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:29.210
My lord... Here.

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:32.400
Are you certain?

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:35.100
You really liked that little carving, right?

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:39.240
Yes. But I want you to have it.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:40.840
I see.

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:41.930
Then...

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:45.470
I'll take care of it.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:52.400
Me, too... I'll never forget you 
or everyone else...

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:07.310
My lord! Akerin! Goodbye!

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:08.660
Be well!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:09.620
See you again, someday!

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:54.840
My whole month's allowance...

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:59.010
Are we back?

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:01.090
Yeah.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.380
What time is it?

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:15.750
Oh, yeah! It broke.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:31.110
It wasn't a dream... Right?

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:41.090
Ever since I was little,

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:44.300
I've always gotten caught up 
in one problem or another.

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:51.390
But... Even if it ends up being 
something incredible,

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:56.400
I don't think it's too bad 
sitting back and going with it.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:05.280
I'll try and live 
as best as I can.

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:02.510
I prayed to God, and I got a Conquest Load!

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:06.010
Didn't this happen before?

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:09.430
I went up those stairs...

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:12.250
I wonder if everyone's doing well.

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:16.680
That dog looks like Shiro...

00:22:18.350 --> 00:22:21.400
It can't be... Right?

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:39.290
Shiro?

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:44.590
Girl, what are you doing here?

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:47.210
It is Shiro!

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:50.680
This is my world.

00:22:50.680 --> 00:22:52.220
What about you?

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:54.380
What are you doing, sneaking around here?

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:57.600
Sorry, I don't have time to play with you.

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:00.260
What? That's not fair!

00:23:00.260 --> 00:23:02.610
You can tell me, right?

00:23:03.630 --> 00:23:07.160
F-F-Fine. Just a little.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:08.440
Yay!

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:09.950
Actually...

00:23:10.620 --> 00:23:12.280
I see...

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:23.820
<b>The End</b>
